  ('cs_abigail-johnson_career', 'ent_abigail-johnson', 'career', 'Career', 'Abigail Pierrepont Johnson (born December 19, 1961) is an American billionaire businesswoman, heiress and chief executive of Fidelity Investments. Her family and their affiliates own approximately 40% of Fidelity Investments, which was founded by her grandfather, Edward C. Johnson II.
